"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we use the fact that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"205\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lies on <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"206\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.18em; margin-bottom: -0